msgid "Effect on Failsafes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:317
#: 0f5d8456679242468d5bb039091b0ee0
msgid "It may be necessary to extend the RC failsafe timeout due to lag and loss of messages on the telemetry link.  This can be done by increasing the :ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT <copter:RC_FS_TIMEOUT>` parameter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:320
#: 28adf20e35fe4a938c5ceae7dcaf779f
msgid "Handling both Regular RC and MAVLink RC input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:322
#: a4af3b2bf9184df684c0bf3148a5f54e
msgid "If MAVLink based RC input is sent from the GCS this will generally override the regular RC input.  If the MAVLink RC input stops, ArduPilot falls back to regular RC input within a few seconds.  This timeout is configurable using the :ref:`RC_OVERRIDE_TIME <copter:RC_OVERRIDE_TIME>` parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:324
#: 4f458846a6ef4126ad69135bd0b94aa2
msgid "The \"RC Override Enable\" :ref:`auxiliary switch <copter:common-auxiliary-functions>` can be used to allow a pilot with a regular RC to forcibly disable any MAVLink RC input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:326
#: 6bd692955e0c4b3b8876b560ed7a9551
msgid "The :ref:`RC_OPTIONS <copter:RC_OPTIONS>` parameter includes an \"Ignore MAVLink Overrides\" option that can be used to more permanently disable MAVLink RC input"
msgstr ""
